Behavior changes
----------------

These differences from the upstream code are intended. They are recorded here
because they change what the code does rather than where it lives, so no diff
of the copied files would reveal them.

  - +k8s:conversion-gen=k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/rbac no longer performs its conversion effect at import time.
    cause: type policy prune-internal for k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/rbac paired with k8s.io/api/rbac/v1
    a retained file still carries a generator directive naming the pruned package,
    so the directive is stripped and recorded in provenance. It is not reachable
    through the generated public API.
  - +k8s:deepcopy-gen=false no longer performs its conversion effect at import time.
    cause: type policy prune-internal for k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/rbac paired with k8s.io/api/rbac/v1
