    so the directive is stripped and recorded in provenance. It is not reachable
    through the generated public API.
  - +k8s:deepcopy-gen=package no longer performs its conversion effect at import time.
    cause: type policy prune-internal for k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/rbac paired with k8s.io/api/rbac/v1
    a retained file still carries a generator directive naming the pruned package,
    so the directive is stripped and recorded in provenance. It is not reachable
    through the generated public API.
  - +k8s:defaulter-gen=TypeMeta no longer performs its conversion effect at import time.
    cause: type policy prune-internal for k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/rbac paired with k8s.io/api/rbac/v1
